<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.offer.commits ~ the hand commits, and the promoted rite stands

Every wiki wears promotion capability; its edge holds (face, wiki, digest). The AI prepares and flags; the hand commits and raises. The wiki rides `wiki=` (absent: the daemon wiki), the face `face=N`, and every answer prints as JSON.

`trust commit <digest>` promotes the item the digest names. It signs under the face's grant and a ward route, so a person runs it at a real terminal; an AI seat prepares and names the command.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ one-digest · in-a-wiki

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`one-digest` params=`digest/<digest> ~ commit one promotion`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`in-a-wiki` params=`digest/<digest> wiki/garden ~ commit it into one wiki`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ digest · wiki · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`digest` params=`takes/hex64 needs/required seat/1 as/<digest> ~ the promotion's digest, 64 lowercase hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wiki` params=`takes/wiki-name ~ the wiki the promotion belongs to; absent, the daemon wiki`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ which face's promotion plane this call reads or acts on, by persona index (a whole number from 0)`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ~ a hand alone decides: an AI harness refuses promote-needs-hand, naming the command the operator runs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ promote-digest-malformed · promote-needs-hand

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`promote-digest-malformed` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.commits digest/<digest>]] ~ name a hex64 digest`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`promote-needs-hand` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.prepares digest/<digest> why/<reason>]] ~ a hand must decide; an AI seat prepares and the operator commits`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ committed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`committed` params=`exit/0 ~ the promotion stands; the answer prints as JSON`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

